{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach it, grab if possible, check properties, do specific task, then move to destination. If not, scan area or take break. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = TakeBreak    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    />\"",
